    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376450/extras/3d0c20eb7cff9401f1b5ccedfd3560c1.poster.avif?t=1754092437\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376450/extras/3d0c20eb7cff9401f1b5ccedfd3560c1.webm?t=1754092437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376450/extras/3d0c20eb7cff9401f1b5ccedfd3560c1.mp4?t=1754092437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A Cardinal, an expert in the occult, was sent with his acolytes to a remote island.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The mission was to unravel the secrets of an ancient civilization...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your task is to find them...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But what you will discover will test your faith... and your humanity.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Descripci\u00f3n</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lighthouse Of The Souls is a third-person action Roguelite with RPG mechanics and realistic graphics. Face the challenges of a dark world alone or with friends, where survival will depend on your skill and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376450/extras/699196bc1b3e88c3d3f240ead7d49dc9.poster.avif?t=1754092437\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376450/extras/699196bc1b3e88c3d3f240ead7d49dc9.webm?t=1754092437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376450/extras/699196bc1b3e88c3d3f240ead7d49dc9.mp4?t=1754092437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Key Features</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Purge Zones:</strong> Clean areas infested with corruption by completing different missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration:</strong> Immerse yourself in a realistic, dark and immersive environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face Enemies:</strong> Eliminate different enemies, who will test your skill in intense combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Equipment:</strong> Use the souls you collect to buy and upgrade your equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Improve your character:</strong> Gain experience and upgrade  skills that fit your play style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Travel through portals:</strong> Face powerful bosses that represent the ultimate corruption, accessing their domains through portals.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Prepare to fight so that the souls of humanity can find their rest.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376450/extras/5dd05ab00ec037652b01dc0fc7fb809c.avif?t=1754092437\" data-has-big /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Choose your Character</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swiss Guard</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Samurai</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exorcist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dakota Warrior  </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376450/extras/3d0c20eb7cff9401f1b5ccedfd3560c1.poster.avif?t=1754092437\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376450/extras/3d0c20eb7cff9401f1b5ccedfd3560c1.webm?t=1754092437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376450/extras/3d0c20eb7cff9401f1b5ccedfd3560c1.mp4?t=1754092437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A Cardinal, an expert in the occult, was sent with his acolytes to a remote island.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The mission was to unravel the secrets of an ancient civilization...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your task is to find them...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But what you will discover will test your faith... and your humanity.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Descripci\u00f3n</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lighthouse Of The Souls is a third-person action Roguelite with RPG mechanics and realistic graphics. Face the challenges of a dark world alone or with friends, where survival will depend on your skill and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376450/extras/699196bc1b3e88c3d3f240ead7d49dc9.poster.avif?t=1754092437\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376450/extras/699196bc1b3e88c3d3f240ead7d49dc9.webm?t=1754092437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376450/extras/699196bc1b3e88c3d3f240ead7d49dc9.mp4?t=1754092437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Key Features</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Purge Zones:</strong> Clean areas infested with corruption by completing different missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration:</strong> Immerse yourself in a realistic, dark and immersive environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face Enemies:</strong> Eliminate different enemies, who will test your skill in intense combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Equipment:</strong> Use the souls you collect to buy and upgrade your equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Improve your character:</strong> Gain experience and upgrade  skills that fit your play style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Travel through portals:</strong> Face powerful bosses that represent the ultimate corruption, accessing their domains through portals.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Prepare to fight so that the souls of humanity can find their rest.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376450/extras/5dd05ab00ec037652b01dc0fc7fb809c.avif?t=1754092437\" data-has-big /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Choose your Character</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swiss Guard</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Samurai</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exorcist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dakota Warrior  </p></li></ul>",
